  id: preset-glass
  displayName: Pyromancer (Glass Cannon)
  playstyle: glass-cannon
  description: 'Objective: spend mana on huge fire damage. Glass Heart: -35% max HP, +30% spell damage. Mana Surge: +20% on casts paying 30+ MP. Pyromancy: +25% Fire components. Conservation: a well-played Strike restores 5 MP. Focus primes the next attack by +60%.

    Trade-off: 650 HP; Inferno (45 MP) competes with survival; conservation turns are weak.'
